§ `62A. Evidence through a live video or live television link`

`s62A child witness with permission` MEANS `Video Link Facts` WITH
    `the kind of proceedings` IS `civil proceedings`
    `the proceedings are proceedings for contempt of court` IS FALSE
    `the witness is below 18 years of age` IS TRUE
    `it is expressly agreed between the parties that evidence may be so given` IS FALSE
    `the witness is outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the court is satisfied that it is expedient in the interests of justice` IS FALSE
    `the court gives permission` IS TRUE
    `the application describes the arrangements the parties have agreed to ensure the integrity and quality of the evidence` IS FALSE
    `all the parties to the civil proceedings expressly agree under section 11(3)(b) of the Family Justice Act 2014, section 8(3)(b) of the State Courts Act 1970 or section 8A(3)(b) of the Supreme Court of Judicature Act 1969` IS FALSE

