#ASSERT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(a) a certified copy`

#ASSERT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(b) a photocopy by a process that ensures accuracy`

#ASSERT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(c) a copy compared with the original`

#ASSERT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(d) a counterpart against a party who did not execute it`

#ASSERT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(e) an oral account by a person who saw the document`

#ASSERT NOT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65(b) an electronic copy within Explanation 3`

#ASSERT NOT `the thing produced is secondary evidence of the document` `s65 ill e an oral account of a copy`

