§ `76 to 80B. Public documents`

`s76(a)(i) an act of the sovereign authority` MEANS `Public Document Facts` WITH
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of the sovereign authority` IS TRUE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of an official body or tribunal` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of a public officer, legislative, judicial or executive, of Singapore, of a part of the Commonwealth or of a foreign country` IS FALSE
    `the document is a public record kept in Singapore of a private document` IS FALSE

`s76(a)(ii) a record of an official tribunal` MEANS `Public Document Facts` WITH
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of the sovereign authority` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of an official body or tribunal` IS TRUE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of a public officer, legislative, judicial or executive, of Singapore, of a part of the Commonwealth or of a foreign country` IS FALSE
    `the document is a public record kept in Singapore of a private document` IS FALSE

`s76(a)(iii) a record of a public officer` MEANS `Public Document Facts` WITH
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of the sovereign authority` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of an official body or tribunal` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of a public officer, legislative, judicial or executive, of Singapore, of a part of the Commonwealth or of a foreign country` IS TRUE
    `the document is a public record kept in Singapore of a private document` IS FALSE

`s76(b) a public record of a private document` MEANS `Public Document Facts` WITH
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of the sovereign authority` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of an official body or tribunal` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of a public officer, legislative, judicial or executive, of Singapore, of a part of the Commonwealth or of a foreign country` IS FALSE
    `the document is a public record kept in Singapore of a private document` IS TRUE

`s77 a private document` MEANS `Public Document Facts` WITH
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of the sovereign authority` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of an official body or tribunal` IS FALSE
    `the document forms the acts or records of the acts of a public officer, legislative, judicial or executive, of Singapore, of a part of the Commonwealth or of a foreign country` IS FALSE
    `the document is a public record kept in Singapore of a private document` IS FALSE

