    `the copy bears, written at its foot, a certificate that it is a true copy of the document or part of it` IS TRUE
    `the certificate is dated and subscribed by the officer with the officer's name and official title` IS FALSE
    `the officer is authorised by law to make use of a seal` IS FALSE
    `the officer has sealed the certificate` IS FALSE
    `the officer has the custody of the document or is authorised in the ordinary course of official duty to deliver such copies` IS TRUE

`s78 no certificate` MEANS `Certified Copy Facts` WITH
