`s80(2) a Commonwealth statute printed by the Government Printer` MEANS `Commonwealth Statute Copy Facts` WITH
    `the copy is of an Act, Ordinance or Statute passed by the legislature of a country in the Commonwealth, or of an order, regulation or other instrument made under its authority` IS TRUE
    `the copy purports to be printed by the Government Printer of that country` IS TRUE

`s80(2) a copy not purporting to be Government-printed` MEANS `Commonwealth Statute Copy Facts` WITH
    `the copy is of an Act, Ordinance or Statute passed by the legislature of a country in the Commonwealth, or of an order, regulation or other instrument made under its authority` IS TRUE
    `the copy purports to be printed by the Government Printer of that country` IS FALSE

