#ASSERT NOT `the copy is received in evidence without proof that it was printed by the Government Printer` `s80(2) a copy not purporting to be Government-printed`

`s80A a print from a film of a destroyed document` MEANS `Film Print Facts` WITH
    `the print purports to be made from a film of a document in the possession of the Government or a specified statutory body` IS TRUE
    `while the document was in the custody or control of the Government or the specified statutory body the film was taken in order to keep a permanent record` IS TRUE
    `the document photographed was subsequently destroyed` IS TRUE
    `the document photographed was so damaged as to be wholly or partly indecipherable` IS FALSE
    `the document photographed was lost` IS FALSE
    `the document photographed had passed out of the custody or control of the Government or the specified statutory body` IS FALSE
    `the body is a statutory body specified in the Second Schedule` IS FALSE
    `a certificate under section 80A(2) purports to be signed by a public officer or an employee of the specified statutory body having custody or control of the film` IS FALSE

